	<li><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/conditions-and-treatments/disabilities/low-vision">Low vision</a></li>
</ul>

<hr class="full-width" />
<h3><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/conditions-and-treatments/treatments-and-surgery">Treatments and surgery</a></h3>

<p>Sometimes you&rsquo;ll need medication to treat a health problem. Or you may require surgery. Learn more about these treatments.</p>

<ul>
	<li><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/conditions-and-treatments/treatments-and-surgery/breast-implants">Breast implants</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/conditions-and-treatments/treatments-and-surgery/knee-hip-replacement">Knee/hip replacement</a></li>
