	<li><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/conditions-and-treatments/treatments-and-surgery/postoperative-problems">Postoperative problems</a></li>
</ul>

<hr class="full-width" />
<h3><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/conditions-and-treatments/school-exclusion">School exclusion</a></h3>

<p>To stop sickness from spreading, you should keep your child at home when they are ill. Find out how long for some common childhood illnesses. <a class="read-more" href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/conditions-and-treatments/school-exclusion">Read more</a></p>
